===================================================================

General

===================================================================

Ignore Operating System generated files

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

Ignore environment variables & secrets

Ignore general log files

*.log

===================================================================

Java / Spring Boot

===================================================================

Since /news-source/ contains the decompiled source

for this project, we are intentionally not ignoring it.

If this were a standard Java project with original source,

we would ignore build/ and target/ directories, e.g.:

target/

.mvn/

build/

*.jar

*.war

===================================================================

JavaScript / Nuxt.js (in /www/news-website/)

===================================================================

Dependencies

/www/news-website/node_modules/

Build cache and output

/www/news-website/.nuxt/
/www/news-website/.output/
/www/news-website/dist/

Local data (e.g., the contents.sqlite file)

/www/news-website/.data/

Package manager logs

npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

===================================================================

Python (in /WSTN/ and /www/)

===================================================================

Compiled bytecode

pycache/
*.pyc

Virtual Environments

This will ignore 'venv', '.venv', etc.

venv/
.venv/

===================================================================

Go (in /www/weather-backend/)

===================================================================

Ignore the compiled binary (the 'backend' file)

/www/weather-backend/backend

